<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-6202] Decode URL-encoded spaces in VFS notebook filenames</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-6202</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Summary&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Summary&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Notebook folders and notes whose names contain spaces are rendered with &lt;tt&gt;%20&lt;/tt&gt; in the Zeppelin notebook-tree UI (e.g., &lt;tt&gt;Flink%20Tutorial&lt;/tt&gt;), reducing readability for users on all platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;RootCause&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Root Cause&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The current path-normalisation logic uses&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
fileObject.getName().getURI().replace(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;file:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;///&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;/&quot;&lt;/span&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;which preserves URL-encoded characters such as &lt;tt&gt;%20&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Fix&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Fix&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Apply a UTF-8 URL decode step before the &lt;tt&gt;&quot;file:///&quot;&lt;/tt&gt; replacement:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; noteFileName = URLDecoder.decode(
&#160; &#160; fileObject.getName().getURI(), StandardCharsets.UTF_8
).replace(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;file:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;///&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;/&quot;&lt;/span&gt;); &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Converts &lt;tt&gt;%20&lt;/tt&gt; back to literal spaces for human-friendly display.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Keeps existing Windows-specific handling of the &lt;tt&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;file:///&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;file:///&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/tt&gt; prefix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;HowtoReproduce&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;How to Reproduce&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Create or import a note whose title contains a space (e.g., &lt;b&gt;&#8220;Python Tutorial&#8221;&lt;/b&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Observe the notebook list: the title appears as &lt;tt&gt;Python%20Tutorial&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;HowtoVerifytheFix&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;How to Verify the Fix&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Build Zeppelin with this patch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Open the same workspace: the title now displays correctly as &lt;b&gt;&#8220;Python Tutorial&#8221;&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Run the existing unit tests; no regressions expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;AffectedComponents&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Affected Components&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;zeppelin-zengine&lt;/tt&gt; (VFS note storage path normalisation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Screenshots%28Before%2FAfter%29&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Screenshots (Before / After)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(Attach before/after images demonstrating the &lt;tt&gt;%20&lt;/tt&gt; &#8594; space change.)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Notes&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Notes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;No production logic other than string decoding is altered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;UTF-8 decoding is safe for all supported OSes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


